{"concept_id":"public-source-boundary","content_sha256":"sha256:d829cbeeec7f25a474679be410dc4d4addee870379f5e9ff09e91bd99a955d96","correct_option_ids":["a"],"domain":"question-authoring","explanation":"公开资料只能支持主题归纳和原创训练题，不能把未证实内容包装成真实内部题，也不应复制受保护题库。","id":"q-company-interview-source-boundary-001","options":[{"id":"a","text":"基于公开岗位、技术文档和公开面试主题生成原创训练题，并标注来源类型"},{"id":"b","text":"把未经证实的内部题目标记成官方原题"},{"id":"c","text":"复制竞品题库全文作为本地题目"},{"id":"d","text":"删除来源字段以免影响练习体验"}],"prompt":"收录“大厂面经题目”时，哪种表述最符合公开资料治理要求？","schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"judgment","source_refs":[{"kind":"competitor_analysis","title":"Public-source question authoring policy","url":"https://www.deep-ml.com/interview-prep/inference-engineer-general?role=inference-engineer&tab=path"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"source-governance","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
